."],"jaJP":["治癒をお頼み申す"]},"keys":["cv_cyborg_monk_CoopHeal"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/530/5300024@1018903676650367712"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/530/5300024"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/530/5300024@-6319652676977285251"]},"audioName":"5300024"},{"type":"CoopRun","label":"战斗-注意","texts":{"zhCN":["诸位，快逃！"],"enUS":["Everyone, flee!"],"jaJP":["皆、退避するのだ！"]},"keys":["cv_cyborg_monk_CoopRun"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/530/5300025@9104834198842525705"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/530/5300025"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/530/5300025@2001397916271115509"]},"audioName":"5300025"},{"type":"CoopWin","label":"战斗-胜利","texts":{"zhCN":["嫉妒皆为烦恼，莫要让烦恼的烈焰将你吞噬。"],"enUS":["Do not let the flames of jealousy consume you."],"jaJP":["勝ったからとて煩悩の炎に焼かれぬよう"]},"keys":["cv_cyborg_monk_CoopWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/530/5300026@5105847769843598072"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/530/5300026"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/530/5300026@8547653712441737601"]},"audioName":"5300026"},{"type":"CoopMVP","label":"战斗-最佳队员","texts":{"zhCN":["消逝之都江河，九十九曲必东流…此乃必然之果。"],"enUS":["Like how the river of Shen City always flows east no matter how many times it twists and turns… this too is but a natural outcome."],"jaJP":["シェン市の川が九十九度うねろうとも東へ流れるように、これもまた必然"]},"keys":["cv_cyborg_monk_CoopMVP"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/530/5300027@666937147626783966"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/530/5300027"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/530/5300027@2819081595490048554"]},"audioName":"5300027"},{"type":"CoopHi","label":"战斗-问候","texts":{"zhCN":["且莫担心，贫僧愿与施主同行。"],"enUS":["Do not worry. I will be with you."],"jaJP":["心配無用、拙僧が力添え致そう"]},"keys":["cv_cyborg_monk_CoopHi"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/o